Description:
Aircraft-Center.com started in 2010 as a small website mainly focussed on the Dutch aircraft market. Today, we are a fully grown platform for worldwide airraft sales.

After many months of hard work, we are proud to present a complete new version of the website, allowing us to take the next step in the future of aircraft sales.

The website features:

    An International platform to connect aircraft dealers with potential buyers;
    English, Russian, Arabic and Chinese language options, making it easy to reach clients everywhere;
    Multi-Lingual add listing form, giving dealers the opportunity to post adds in any of the above mentioned languages;
    A currency converter which automatically converts all prices in the currency selected by the client;
    Extended search form and filters to precisely tune searches to  the needs of the client;
    An easy to use photo and video manager as well as a factsheet capabilities;
    A loan / mortgage calculator;
    The option to save your searches. We will send you a notification as soon as a listing is posted that matches your requirements;
    A translation service to help dealers reach clients in different languages;

Our Aircraft-center iPhone and Android app will soon be available in their respective app stores.  

The Multi-Lingual feature is fully functional but we are still in process of translating certain parts of the site.
